From 9da3923176d88e6c44a7802fa7d6374ae40414f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LCS-Dev <xtremexspc@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:02:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(osax): Support the scripting addition on macOS 27.

- Add macOS 27 arm64e offsets and patterns for dock.spaces, add_space, remove_space and animation_time that match both the arm64e and arm64e.x1 Dock slices.

- Leave dppm, move_space and set_front_window unresolved on macOS 27 because DPDesktopPictureManager is gone and set_front_window has no caller.

- Fall back to currentSpaceForDisplay: with displayForSPID: when the Dock no longer implements currentSpaceForDisplayUUID:.

- Accept macOS 27 in the payload version check and bump OSAX_VERSION to 2.1.31.

- Treat macOS 27 like Tahoe in the client version gates, including the SLSGetWindowSubLevel MIG id.

- Document the change in the changelog.
