From 8135286ece81646f12e6afaf59667e29ae1e1ae9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LCS-Dev <xtremexspc@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:03:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(osax): Guard space handlers against unknown space ids.

- Return early when SLSCopyManagedDisplayForSpace yields no display, which previously aborted the Dock inside SLSManagedDisplayGetCurrentSpace.

- Skip add_space and remove_space when the Dock has no matching space or display space instead of calling them with nil.

- Skip spaces without a display while resolving a display space by uuid.
---
 src/osax/payload.m | 32 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
